  "name": "Stack Auth",
  "abstract": "Open-source user infrastructure platform, rebranded as Hexclave. Starts from authentication (password, one-time code, magic link, passkey, OAuth and CLI auth) and adds teams with roles and permissions, API keys, signed webhooks, emails, payments and analytics on one user model. Ships SDKs for Next.js, React, TanStack Start and plain JavaScript plus a REST API, with pre-built UI components and project JWTs verifiable through a JWKS endpoint. Client code is MIT licensed and server components AGPL-3.0, with enterprise licenses available. Hosted cloud with a Free plan up to 10,000 auth users, or self-hosted.",
